{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1408186-can-dragon-blooded-craft-artifacts","id":1408186,"title":"Can Dragon-Blooded Craft Artifacts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-14T11:06:01-07:00","id":1408186,"title":"Can Dragon-Blooded Craft Artifacts?","content":"I know that they can, in principle, but mechanically, can a Dragon-Blooded actually do so, and if so, how? The Dragon-Blooded Craft Charms seem a bit lacking for the purpose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T11:13:13-07:00","id":1408189,"title":"","content":"If I'm not mistaken a good DB crafter will be able to craft artefact 2 and 3 without too much problem, 4 might be close to off-limits without all optimisations (and even with), and 5 is impossible. Haven't done the maths in a while but most likely you can summon JohnDoe to answer this.<br /> <br /> Behold my Notifying The Wise And Commendable Technique : <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar531_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"531\" data-vbnamecard=\"531\">JohnDoe244</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T11:41:30-07:00","id":1408198,"title":"","content":"To quickly answer the question, yes, DBs definitely can craft artifacts. Not as fast or with quite as much overwhelming success as Solars can, but they can. Lower-level artifacts for sure, anyway. The higher-level ones, particularly NA-level artifacts, are more out of reach.<br /> <br /> An Essence 1 DB, with Attribute 5, Craft 5, a specialty in the relevant type of craft, and the Craft Excellency, can reliably throw 20 dice at a Craft roll (5 Attribute + 5 Ability + 1 specialty + 1 exceptional tools + 2 for a 2-point stunt + 6 for a full Excellency), with 2 bonus successes (1 for spending a wp, 1 for a 2-point stunt). That's an average of 12 successes per roll, so an average of 8 net successes for the difficulty of 5, meaning that the DB can craft an Artifact 2 (requiring 30 successes) <i>very</i> reliably, and an Artifact 3 (requiring 50) slightly less than half the time.<br /> <br /> The numbers improve at higher Essence with more Craft charms. At Essence 2, with Flawless Facet Realization and Strike the Dragon-Anvil, the probability goes well above 50% for Artifact 3, and to something like 40% for Artifact 4. At Essence 3, with access to the signature charms Eternal Omphalos Forge or Blazing Dragon-Smith Arete, it gets even better. If I'm doing the probability math right, Eternal Omphalos Forge is better as your first pick, as it will more reliably allow producing Artifact 4s (putting you above 50% chance), though Blazing Dragon-Smith Arete <i>eventually</i> gives you more dice.<br /> <br /> And things continue to improve. At Essence 5, a DB craftsperson can produce Artifact 5s at close to 50% reliability. So, yeah, DBs can definitely make artifacts. As the setting suggests, they can't produce the absolute height of artifice that the Solars could, but that's why Creation is lessened and brought down from the heights it reached in the First Age - the people capable of producing the wonders alone were all killed and their Exaltations sealed away, and the other Exalted, who might have been able to produce such heights if they had worked together and strengthened each other, instead fought each other in a series of destructive wars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T11:45:56-07:00","id":1408199,"title":"","content":"Nice I didn't know elder DB could actually craft Artifact 5","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T12:00:52-07:00","id":1408209,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1408186-can-dragon-blooded-craft-artifacts?p=1408199#post1408199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nice I didn't know elder DB could actually craft Artifact 5</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Actually (and, again, assuming I'm doing the math right), an Essence 5 DB with all the relevant craft charms, stunts, etc. averages 138 successes over the course of 6 rolls, meaning they've got comfortably <i>more</i> than a 50% chance of producing an Artifact 5, and could often produce one in just 5 rolls, in fact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T12:05:35-07:00","id":1408212,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kelly Pedersen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1408186-can-dragon-blooded-craft-artifacts?p=1408209#post1408209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Actually (and, again, assuming I'm doing the math right), an Essence 5 DB with all the relevant craft charms, stunts, etc. averages 138 successes over the course of 6 rolls, meaning they've got comfortably <i>more</i> than a 50% chance of producing an Artifact 5, and could often produce one in just 5 rolls, in fact.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think when I first did my Maths to check it out I didn't account for stunts, WP and specialized tools, so I left with the impression that Artifacts 5 were extremely hard for them, and 4 were just manageable. I guess I have to actualize my scale for DB craft by 1 up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My homebrew (Leave comments if you want to help improve) : <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1hPx-Q2jlDgAIZX_d0wQWmJkZMN51jas4QNp5meeQjgo/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">A quick recap of all the pools and stats for Quick Exalted 3E characters</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24291-chausse","name":"Chausse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T12:31:57-07:00","id":1408217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chausse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1408186-can-dragon-blooded-craft-artifacts?p=1408212#post1408212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think when I first did my Maths to check it out I didn't account for stunts, WP and specialized tools,</div> </div> </div> </div>Spending wp and having exceptional tools should really be an expected part of the roll, in my opinion, given that having access to them is pretty much trivial for a crafting character. Assuming a 2-point stunt is a bit more questionable, given the differing standards between STs about what qualifies, but I feel like most would be reasonably lenient for a DB making such a huge project, so I include those in the math as well.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T12:52:26-07:00","id":1408224,"title":"","content":"Going full stunts and willpower and stuff I calculate that an essence 3 DBhas about a 5% chance of doing it, but an essence 5 DB has a 98% chance. Assuming no evocations from an artifact factory cathedral or the like. The reason the difference is so huge is an essence 5 DB gets to double up on signature charms and upgrade a previous charm to double 8s.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T14:11:47-07:00","id":1408235,"title":"","content":"While they aren't going to apply to all Artifacts, any Artifacts that can benefit from Bracers of Universal Crafting should make things considerably easier.... what with the +3 dice over normal tools thing,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T14:57:51-07:00","id":1408247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LadyLens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1408186-can-dragon-blooded-craft-artifacts#post1408186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know that they can, in principle, but mechanically, can a Dragon-Blooded actually do so, and if so, how? The Dragon-Blooded Craft Charms seem a bit lacking for the purpose.</div> </div> </div> </div>Going on just excellency + stunt 2 + wp on every roll:<br /> Terminus 6, difficulty 5 baseline.<br /> <br /> Odds of success:<br /> A2: 99.55%<br /> A3: 41.35%<br /> A4: 0.03%<br /> A5: 0,0000000003%<br /> N/A: 0<br /> <br /> Now let's add the other charms.<br /> Flawless Facet Realization<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> A3: 69.81%<br /> A4: 0.31% (10 times more likely!.... &gt;.&gt;)<br /> A5: 0.00000003% (100 times more likely!... &lt;.&lt;)<br /> N/A: 0<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> Alternatively, Strike the Dragon-Anvil<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].ge